        <name>limit</name>
        <qualifiedname>paimon::FullTextSearch::limit</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Maximum number of documents to return. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Purely a truncation switch, orthogonal to <computeroutput>with_score</computeroutput>: set <computeroutput>with_score = true</computeroutput> to get relevance scores; a non-empty <computeroutput>limit</computeroutput> does not by itself imply scoring. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
